WEBVTT

00:02.377 --> 00:03.211
Captioning Provided By:
MTV Networks
字幕提供者：
MTV网络

00:03.294 --> 00:04.170
Are ya ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:04.254 --> 00:05.088
Kids: Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：是的，是的，队长。

00:05.171 --> 00:06.381
I can't  hear  you.
我听不到你说话。

00:06.464 --> 00:08.258
Kids:
Aye, aye, Captain.
孩子们：
是的，是的，船长。

00:08.341 --> 00:11.010
♪ Ohh... ♪
♪ 哦...♪

00:11.094 --> 00:13.430
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:13.722 --> 00:15.640
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:15.724 --> 00:17.559
Captain: ♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
队长：♪ 吸水性的，黄色的
他是多孔的 ♪

00:17.642 --> 00:19.060
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:19.436 --> 00:21.688
Captain: ♪ If nautical nonsense
be somethin' you wish ♪
船长：♪ 如果是航海方面的废话
成为你所希望的那样 ♪

00:21.771 --> 00:23.106
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:23.440 --> 00:25.525
Captain: ♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
船长：♪ 然后降落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:25.608 --> 00:26.651
Kids: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
孩子们：♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:26.735 --> 00:27.610
Captain: ♪ Ready? ♪
队长：♪ 准备好了吗？ ♪

00:27.944 --> 00:29.529
All: ♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
全部： ♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:29.612 --> 00:31.656
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:31.740 --> 00:33.533
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝 ♪

00:33.616 --> 00:37.203
Captain: ♪ SpongeBob
SquarePants ♪
队长：♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤♪

00:58.099 --> 00:59.476
Plankton: Ha, ha.
浮游生物：哈哈哈。

01:02.228 --> 01:03.188
Hold it right there, Plankton.
坚持住，浮游生物。

01:03.271 --> 01:04.939
Krabs.
螃蟹。

01:05.023 --> 01:06.232
I'll take that.
我会接受的。

01:06.316 --> 01:07.650
How did you know it was me?
你怎么知道是我？

01:07.942 --> 01:09.944
Next time, wear a disguise
without your initial on it.
下次请乔装打扮
上面没有您名字的首字母缩写。

01:10.028 --> 01:14.240
Hmm... Perhaps a pepper shaker
was a bit obvious.
嗯...也许是胡椒瓶
有点明显了。

01:14.324 --> 01:15.366
You think?
您认为？

01:15.450 --> 01:16.826
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

01:19.454 --> 01:23.041
Man: Three, two, one, launch.
男：三、二、一，发射。

01:31.257 --> 01:32.091
Plankton: Never.
浮游生物：从来没有。

01:32.175 --> 01:33.927
Never  .
绝不  。

01:34.010 --> 01:36.262
I'll never get Krabs's formula.
我永远不会得到蟹老板的配方。

01:36.346 --> 01:39.182
Mr. Krabs is too powerful.
蟹老板太厉害了。

01:39.265 --> 01:43.228
If only there were a way
to render him helpless.
要是有办法就好了
让他无助。

01:43.311 --> 01:44.479
Woman: Aw, look at you.
女：噢，看看你。

01:44.562 --> 01:47.148
You're so small,
tiny and helpless.
你还那么小，
渺小而无助。

01:47.232 --> 01:49.400
Hey, I resent that... Huh?
嘿，我很反感……嗯？

01:49.484 --> 01:51.444
Why, you're so
tiny and helpless
为何你如此
渺小而无助

01:51.528 --> 01:53.947
I could take your formula
whenever I wanted to
我可以采用你的公式
每当我想要的时候

01:54.030 --> 01:56.533
and you couldn't
do a thing about it.
而你不能
做点什么吧。

01:59.828 --> 02:03.122
Something about that woman
reminds me of my mother.
关于那个女人的一些事情
让我想起了我的母亲。

02:03.206 --> 02:04.666
That's it.
就是这样。

02:04.749 --> 02:07.585
Finally, victory  will  be mine.
最后，胜利将属于我。

02:07.669 --> 02:11.131
I'll turn Eugene Krabs
into a powerless...
我会变成尤金克拉布斯
陷入无能为力的...

02:11.214 --> 02:13.591
Baby.
婴儿。

02:16.386 --> 02:17.762
Ooh, a penny.
哦，一分钱。

02:17.846 --> 02:19.681
A trail of pennies.
一便士的踪迹。

02:25.395 --> 02:27.897
Ooh...
哦...

02:28.982 --> 02:30.233
I've done it.
我已经做到了。

02:30.316 --> 02:32.318
Nothing can stop me now.
现在没有什么可以阻止我。

02:32.402 --> 02:34.737
My goo goo gas
will transform Krabs
我的咕咕气体
将改变蟹蟹

02:34.821 --> 02:37.699
into a tiny, helpless infant.
变成一个小而无助的婴儿。

02:38.908 --> 02:40.827
The key to the Krusty Krab.
蟹堡王的钥匙。

02:40.910 --> 02:44.372
This was easier than I hoped.
这比我希望的要容易。

02:45.999 --> 02:47.333
Hmm.
唔。

02:47.417 --> 02:49.460
He's a little bigger
than I imagined.
他稍微大一点
比我想象的要好。

02:49.544 --> 02:51.129
Shiny...
闪亮的...

02:51.212 --> 02:52.297
Plankton: Whoa!
浮游生物：哇！

02:52.380 --> 02:53.590
No, no!
不，不！

02:53.673 --> 02:56.092
Ah, ah, ahh!
啊啊啊啊！

02:56.175 --> 02:57.093
Oof!
钱币！

02:59.470 --> 03:01.180
Whoa!
哇！

03:04.142 --> 03:06.269
Hey, a baby.
嘿，一个婴儿。

03:06.352 --> 03:07.979
What are you doing out
here all alone, baby?
你在外面做什么
宝贝，独自一人在这里吗？

03:08.062 --> 03:10.189
I'll take charge of you
until your mommy shows up.
我来负责你
直到你妈妈出现。

03:11.524 --> 03:14.193
Oh, aren't you just too cute.
哦，你是不是太可爱了。

03:14.277 --> 03:15.361
Coochie-coochie-coo.
咕咕咕。

03:17.447 --> 03:18.615
Plankton: Hello...
浮游生物：你好……

03:18.948 --> 03:20.742
If you're done making
a total fool out of yourself
如果你完成了制作
你自己简直就是个傻瓜

03:20.825 --> 03:22.702
I could use some help
with this lock.
我需要一些帮助
有了这把锁。

03:22.785 --> 03:23.828
Oh, sure thing, Plankton.
哦，当然可以，浮游生物。

03:23.912 --> 03:26.539
There you go little guy.
给你，小家伙。

03:26.623 --> 03:27.707
Yes.
是的。

03:27.790 --> 03:29.876
My plan is working perfectly.
我的计划正在完美地进行。

03:29.959 --> 03:32.712
Now that I've turned Krabs
into a helpless baby
现在我已经变成螃蟹了
变成一个无助的婴儿

03:32.795 --> 03:36.841
the Krabby Patty formula
will be mine.
蟹黄饼配方
将是我的。

03:38.051 --> 03:38.927
Eh?
呃？

03:39.010 --> 03:39.719
Hello.
你好。

03:39.802 --> 03:41.930
Police, police!
警察，警察！

03:43.348 --> 03:44.515
Plankton: Fools...
浮游生物：笨蛋……

03:44.599 --> 03:46.184
You'll never hold me.
你永远不会抱紧我。

03:46.267 --> 03:50.438
These primitive shackles
are no match for my genius.
这些原始的枷锁
都敌不过我的天才。

03:50.521 --> 03:53.399
That was easy.
那很容易。

03:53.483 --> 03:55.360
Plankton: I'm free.
浮游生物：我自由了。

03:55.443 --> 03:57.070
Free...
自由的...

03:57.153 --> 03:59.322
Oh, Squidward.
哦，章鱼哥。

03:59.405 --> 04:00.573
Thank Neptune, you're here.
感谢海王星，你来了。

04:00.657 --> 04:01.908
I found this baby all alone.
我独自一人发现了这个婴儿。

04:02.158 --> 04:03.785
But he wasn't really alone,
he was with Plankton
但他其实并不孤单，
他和浮游生物在一起

04:03.868 --> 04:04.786
and he's not a baby.
而且他不是婴儿。

04:04.869 --> 04:06.496
It's Mr. Krabs.
是蟹老板。

04:07.038 --> 04:09.415
Plankton turned him
into an infant so he could
steal the Krabby Patty formula.
浮游生物把他变成了
进入婴儿，这样他就可以
偷走蟹黄派的配方。

04:10.667 --> 04:11.960
What do we do, Squidward?
我们该怎么办，章鱼哥？

04:12.293 --> 04:14.921
Don't know about you,
but I'm going
on my coffee break.
不知道你的情况，
但我要去
在我喝咖啡的休息时间。

04:15.004 --> 04:17.215
A very long coffee break.
一个很长的咖啡休息时间。

04:19.008 --> 04:22.553
And then that blasted
sponge called the cops.
然后就炸了
海绵报了警。

04:22.637 --> 04:23.930
That's just not cricket.
那不是板球。

04:24.013 --> 04:26.182
Now I'll never be
a tyrannical overlord.
现在我永远不会
一个残暴的霸主。

04:26.265 --> 04:28.935
Karen: Do I have to tell you
how to do everything?
凯伦：我必须告诉你吗
怎样做一切？

04:29.018 --> 04:31.771
Next time spray SpongeBob, too.
下次也喷海绵宝宝吧。

04:31.854 --> 04:33.231
Not sure
I follow you.
不确定
我跟着你。

04:33.314 --> 04:34.148
Listen carefully.
仔细听。

04:34.232 --> 04:35.108
Spray...
喷...

04:35.191 --> 04:36.025
Yes.
是的。

04:36.109 --> 04:36.943
Sponge...
海绵...

04:37.026 --> 04:37.694
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

04:37.777 --> 04:38.611
Bob...
鲍勃...

04:38.695 --> 04:39.570
Right.
正确的。

04:39.654 --> 04:40.863
Too.
也。

04:40.947 --> 04:41.781
Now you're just
talking Gibberish.
现在你只是
胡言乱语。

04:41.864 --> 04:43.116
What I really need is to
我真正需要的是

04:43.199 --> 04:44.826
spray Mr. Krabs and SpongeBob.
喷洒蟹蟹先生和海绵宝宝。

04:44.909 --> 04:45.910
Ahh, that's just what...
啊啊，原来是这样啊……

04:45.994 --> 04:47.453
I don't wanna hear anymore
我不想再听了

04:47.537 --> 04:49.122
of your loony schemes, Karen.
你的疯狂计划，凯伦。

04:49.205 --> 04:50.748
I've got work to do.
我还有工作要做。

04:52.291 --> 04:55.044
Aw, what's wrong
Mr. Baby Krabs?
噢，怎么了
蟹宝宝先生？

04:55.128 --> 04:57.130
Are you thirsty?
你渴吗？

04:57.213 --> 04:59.298
That's it, drink up.
就这样，喝了。

05:01.718 --> 05:03.261
OK, maybe you're hungry.
好吧，也许你饿了。

05:03.344 --> 05:05.221
How about a nice
hot Krabby Patty?
怎么样一个好的
辣蟹饼？

05:07.223 --> 05:09.600
Yikes, not even
a Krabby Patty helps.
哎呀，甚至没有
蟹肉饼有帮助。

05:09.684 --> 05:12.103
How 'bout a stack of $20s?
一堆20美元怎么样？

05:12.186 --> 05:13.521
"Hee..."
“嘿嘿……”

05:14.689 --> 05:16.315
Plankton: Hands in the air.
浮游生物：双手举在空中。

05:16.399 --> 05:17.483
: Plankton.
：浮游生物。

05:17.567 --> 05:19.736
That's right, SpongeBob,
I'm back.
没错，海绵宝宝，
我回来了。

05:19.819 --> 05:23.072
And you won't stop me this time.
这次你不会再阻止我了。

05:26.159 --> 05:27.201
What?
什么？

05:27.577 --> 05:31.622
SpongeBob's a baby
but Krabs is back to normal?
海绵宝宝还是个婴儿
但蟹老板恢复正常了吗？

05:34.000 --> 05:36.627
It seems a second dose
acts as an antidote.
看来是第二剂了
作为解毒剂。

05:38.629 --> 05:39.756
One squirt equals baby.
喷一喷就等于生宝宝。

05:39.839 --> 05:41.257
Two squirts equals adult.
喷两次就等于成人。

05:44.677 --> 05:46.346
Or is it three squirts for baby
还是给宝宝喷三喷

05:46.429 --> 05:48.765
and four squirts for adults?
成人可以喷四次吗？

05:48.848 --> 05:51.100
Barnacles,
I've run out of gas.
藤壶，
我的汽油用完了。

05:51.184 --> 05:52.226
Ahem...
咳咳……

05:52.310 --> 05:53.352
Krabs!
螃蟹们！

05:53.436 --> 05:54.979
Nice diaper.
漂亮的尿布。

05:55.063 --> 05:57.356
Plankton: Hold on, hold on,
I think I...
浮游生物：坚持住，坚持住，
我想我...

05:57.440 --> 06:00.193
Yes, I've got it.
是的，我明白了。

06:01.652 --> 06:04.155
There'd better be something
other than bills in here.
最好有一些东西
除了这里的账单。

06:04.238 --> 06:05.239
Plankton.
浮游生物。

06:05.323 --> 06:06.449
Peek-a-boo.
躲猫猫。

06:06.532 --> 06:07.533
Ahh!
啊！

06:07.617 --> 06:08.868
I can't tolerate
我无法忍受

06:08.951 --> 06:10.328
your stinky gas.
你的臭气。

06:11.954 --> 06:13.873
That makes two of us.
这就是我们两个人。

06:13.956 --> 06:15.875
I don't do it
on purpose.
我不做
故意的。

06:15.958 --> 06:17.543
You'll never
catch me, Plankton.
你永远不会
抓住我，浮游生物。

06:17.627 --> 06:18.503
Never.
绝不。

06:18.586 --> 06:20.213
Ooh, another penny.
哦，又一分钱。

06:20.296 --> 06:21.380
Come to papa.
来找爸爸吧。

06:21.464 --> 06:22.381
Now what were we doing?
现在我们在做什么？

06:22.465 --> 06:23.341
This.
这。

06:25.802 --> 06:27.929
What's the matter, baby?
怎么了，宝贝？

06:28.012 --> 06:29.555
You gonna cry?
你会哭吗？

06:29.639 --> 06:31.682
What the heck
happened to you?
到底是什么
你发生了什么事吗？

06:31.766 --> 06:33.351
This isn't baby gas.
这不是婴儿气体。

06:33.434 --> 06:35.561
It's senior citizen spray.
这是老年人喷雾。

06:35.645 --> 06:37.897
Eh, what was that, sonny?
呃，那是什么，儿子？

06:37.980 --> 06:39.816
Out of my way, methuselah.
别挡我的路，玛撒拉。

06:39.899 --> 06:41.526
You're old and useless.
你老了，没用了。

06:41.609 --> 06:43.486
Hold it right there.
把它握在那里。

06:43.569 --> 06:46.614
Old people are our greatest
natural resource.
老人是我们最伟大的人
自然资源。

06:46.697 --> 06:48.991
I salute you, elder citizenry.
我向你们致敬，年长的公民。

06:49.075 --> 06:50.952
I'm getting old
listening to this.
我变老了
听这个。

06:51.035 --> 06:52.829
Let's try this again.
让我们再试一次。

06:54.956 --> 06:58.835
I remember when a quarter
used to cost a nickel.
我记得四分之一的时候
用于花费五分钱。

07:00.670 --> 07:03.131
This baby gas is worthless...
这婴儿气体毫无价值……

07:03.214 --> 07:05.007
At least you're way too old
至少你已经太老了

07:05.091 --> 07:07.969
to stop me from stealing
a Krabby Patty.
阻止我偷窃
蟹肉饼。

07:08.052 --> 07:09.595
What was that, sonny?
那是什么，儿子？

07:09.679 --> 07:13.307
It'll take more time to explain
than you have left.
需要更多时间来解释
比你离开的时间还要长。

07:13.391 --> 07:14.308
What?
什么？

07:16.185 --> 07:18.271
He's got the Krabby Patty.
他有蟹黄饼。

07:18.354 --> 07:19.647
Catch him.
抓住他。

07:19.730 --> 07:20.857
Catch who?
抓住谁？

07:20.940 --> 07:22.859
Oh,  gezhundheit.
哦，gezhundheit。

07:25.862 --> 07:28.072
Victory is mine.
胜利是我的。

07:28.156 --> 07:28.781
Ah!
啊!

07:29.824 --> 07:31.492
Ah!
啊!

07:31.576 --> 07:32.785
Ah!
啊!

07:32.869 --> 07:33.953
Ah!
啊!

07:34.328 --> 07:37.456
Come back here,
you little whippersnapper.
回到这里，
你这个小自命不凡的人。

07:37.540 --> 07:39.876
You kids get
off my lawn.
你们孩子们得到
离开我的草坪。

07:39.959 --> 07:41.460
Whew.
呼。

07:41.544 --> 07:43.004
Ooh, boy.
哦，男孩。

07:43.087 --> 07:45.006
I'll catch up with you, boy.
我会追上你的，孩子。

07:45.089 --> 07:47.758
I'm catching up
with my knitting.
我正在追赶
用我的编织。

07:47.842 --> 07:49.468
That's it.
就是这样。

07:49.552 --> 07:52.513
Knit, you little nitwit.
编织，你这个小白痴。

07:52.597 --> 07:55.183
That was almost too easy.
这太容易了。

07:55.266 --> 07:57.685
What? No!
什么？不！

07:57.768 --> 08:00.563
I demand you
geezers release me!
我要求你
老兄放开我！

08:00.646 --> 08:03.357
Right after the party...
聚会结束后...

08:03.441 --> 08:04.984
The piñata party.
皮纳塔派对。

08:05.067 --> 08:06.652
Plankton: What?
浮游生物：什么？

08:06.736 --> 08:08.821
Man: That's for
calling us old.
男：那是为了
叫我们老了。

08:08.905 --> 08:10.448
Hey, quit it.
嘿，别说了。

08:10.531 --> 08:12.491
I want candy.
我想要糖果。

08:12.575 --> 08:14.911
Plankton: No!
浮游生物：不！

08:16.120 --> 08:19.290
One squirt, plus adult...
Carry the two
一喷，加上成人...
带着两个

08:19.373 --> 08:22.001
gas vector minus
body weight, um-hm...
气体矢量减
体重，嗯……

08:22.084 --> 08:24.503
Square root of SpongeBob...
海绵宝宝的平方根...

08:24.587 --> 08:26.130
Of course.
当然。

08:26.214 --> 08:29.091
The final ingredient
that I've been lacking.
最终成分
我一直缺乏的。

08:29.175 --> 08:32.720
It's so simple, yet so evil.
就是这么简单，却又这么邪恶。

08:32.803 --> 08:35.848
And I know
just the place to get it.
我知道
只是获得它的地方。

08:38.017 --> 08:39.727
Excuse me.
打扰一下。

08:39.810 --> 08:41.395
What aisle did you
get that from?
你走哪条路
从哪里得到的？

08:41.479 --> 08:42.688
You mean the kelpo?
你是说凯尔波吗？

08:42.772 --> 08:44.273
No, that thing.
不，那个东西。

08:44.357 --> 08:46.108
The ugly, drippy, smelly thing.
丑陋的、滴水的、有臭味的东西。

08:46.192 --> 08:48.361
Are you talking about my baby?
你在说我的宝宝吗？

08:48.444 --> 08:49.362
Creep.
蠕变。

08:51.489 --> 08:52.823
Ow, ow, ow!
噢，噢，噢！

08:56.494 --> 08:58.371
Baby powder.
婴儿爽身粉。

08:58.454 --> 09:01.290
This could be just what I need.
这可能正是我所需要的。

09:01.374 --> 09:02.375
Hey, buddy.
嘿，伙计。

09:02.792 --> 09:04.710
Is this made from real
or artificial babies?
这是真人制作的吗
还是人造婴儿？

09:04.794 --> 09:07.046
Ow, ow, ow, ow!
噢，噢，噢，噢！

09:07.129 --> 09:10.883
Plankton: That "powdered baby"
did the trick.
浮游生物：那个“粉宝宝”
成功了。

09:10.967 --> 09:14.720
Now my baby gas
can't possibly fail.
现在我的宝贝气体
不可能失败。

09:14.804 --> 09:16.180
Karen: Just like
all your other plans
凯伦：就像
你所有的其他计划

09:16.264 --> 09:18.182
that couldn't possibly fail?
那不可能失败吗？

09:18.266 --> 09:19.976
What is it now, Karen?
现在怎么样了，凯伦？

09:20.059 --> 09:21.894
I'm saying you should
test your gas
我是说你应该
测试你的气体

09:21.978 --> 09:24.230
before you run over there
all willy-nilly.
在你跑过去之前
都随心所欲。

09:24.313 --> 09:26.732
That's an excellent idea.
这是个好主意。

09:26.816 --> 09:28.859
And I know just the Guinea pig.
我只认识豚鼠。

09:28.943 --> 09:32.321
: Plankton...
Don't you dare.
: 浮游生物...
你不敢。

09:34.657 --> 09:37.576
Karen, speak to me.
凯伦，跟我说话。

09:37.660 --> 09:39.453
It worked.
它起作用了。

09:42.832 --> 09:45.209
Everyone say your "A-B-C's".
每个人都说出你的“A-B-C”。

09:46.669 --> 09:48.421
Now when you
turn into babies...
现在当你
变成婴儿...

09:50.089 --> 09:51.966
You stay babies.
你还是婴儿吧。

09:54.010 --> 09:55.928
Hey, Krabs... Catch.
嘿，蟹蟹...抓住。

10:01.100 --> 10:03.894
What's wrong,
little fellow?
怎么了，
小家伙？

10:10.067 --> 10:12.194
Ahh!
啊！

10:17.283 --> 10:19.994
My moment of triumph.
我的胜利时刻。

10:20.077 --> 10:21.454
Whoa!
哇！

10:21.537 --> 10:22.621
What the...
什么...

10:22.705 --> 10:24.582
Oh, gross.
哦，太恶心了。

10:24.665 --> 10:27.293
I command you to stop
drooling on me.
我命令你停下来
流口水在我身上。

10:27.376 --> 10:28.794
Krabs: Goo.
蟹蟹：咕咕。

10:28.878 --> 10:30.629
Put me down.
把我放下来。

10:30.713 --> 10:32.715
Ow!
噢！

10:32.798 --> 10:34.008
Stop it.
停止吧。

10:34.091 --> 10:37.428
I'm an adult  .
我是一个成年人了。

10:40.514 --> 10:41.807
Yeow!
哟！

10:44.894 --> 10:45.936
Huh?
啊？

10:46.020 --> 10:48.189
I don't believe it.
我不相信。

10:48.272 --> 10:50.816
The Krabby Patty formula.
蟹黄饼配方。

10:50.900 --> 10:52.651
He's teething on it.
他正在磨牙。

10:52.735 --> 10:53.944
Give it here
给这里

10:54.028 --> 10:56.155
you big stupid baby.
你这个大傻宝贝。

10:56.238 --> 10:57.990
Ow.
噢。

11:05.581 --> 11:06.749
I've got it.
我明白了。

11:06.832 --> 11:10.044
Just like taking candy
from a baby.
就像吃糖果一样
来自一个婴儿。

11:10.127 --> 11:11.128
Get it, Krabs?
明白了吗，蟹蟹？

11:11.212 --> 11:14.548
Like taking candy from you.
就像从你手里夺走糖果一样。

11:14.632 --> 11:16.425
Hey, what are you doing?
嘿，你在做什么？

11:18.761 --> 11:19.678
Whoo...
呼...

11:23.974 --> 11:25.559
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

11:26.769 --> 11:28.687
Ahem.
咳咳。

11:28.771 --> 11:33.109
Mama's evil little genius
needs a diaper!
妈妈的邪恶小天才
需要尿布！

11:46.831 --> 11:48.707
Order up.
订购吧。

11:48.791 --> 11:53.754
Go now and bless the taste buds
of your lucky connoisseur.
现在就去祝福味蕾
您幸运的鉴赏家。

11:53.838 --> 11:55.256
Mwah.
哇。

11:59.927 --> 12:01.387
It went in my mouth.
它进入了我的嘴。

12:02.763 --> 12:05.474
Choking on sentiment.
情绪哽咽。

12:06.976 --> 12:08.352
Like poison.
就像毒药一样。

12:08.436 --> 12:10.229
OK, you sit this
one out Squidward.
好的，你坐这个
一出章鱼哥。

12:10.312 --> 12:12.815
This will be a special delivery
from the chef.
这将是一次特殊递送
来自厨师。

12:12.898 --> 12:14.233
For your dining pleasure.
为了您的用餐愉快。

12:14.316 --> 12:16.777
Two double Krabby Patties
cooked to perfection
两块双层蟹肉饼
煮至完美

12:16.861 --> 12:20.406
complimented by a side of coral
bits and a jumbo diet soda.
配以珊瑚的一面
碎块和一大杯无糖汽水。

12:20.489 --> 12:23.868
Topped off with
a little extra love.
结束于
一点额外的爱。

12:28.831 --> 12:31.083
Enjoy!
享受！

12:33.878 --> 12:35.004
It's the little details
就是这些小细节

12:35.296 --> 12:37.256
that they really appreciate,
isn't it, Squidward?
他们真的很感激，
不是吗，章鱼哥？

12:37.339 --> 12:38.632
Uh...
呃...

12:38.841 --> 12:41.010
Oh, yeah, you've really
touched  his  life.
哦，是的，你确实
触动了他的生活。

12:42.636 --> 12:45.806
Nothing beats making quality
food for good people
没有什么比制造品质更好的了
为好人提供食物

12:45.890 --> 12:47.808
with discriminating tastes.
具有辨别的品味。

12:47.892 --> 12:48.767
Quality food?
优质食品？

12:48.851 --> 12:49.685
Yeah!
是的！

12:49.768 --> 12:50.603
Good people?
好人？

12:50.686 --> 12:51.604
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

12:51.687 --> 12:53.272
Discriminating tastes?
品味歧视？

12:53.355 --> 12:54.648
Testify!
作证！

12:54.732 --> 12:55.900
D'oh...
哦...

12:59.236 --> 13:01.947
Only pathetic losers
with horrible taste
只有可悲的失败者
味道很糟糕

13:02.031 --> 13:02.907
would eat this garbage.
会吃这些垃圾。

13:10.164 --> 13:11.207
Squidward...
章鱼哥...

13:11.540 --> 13:12.917
The Krusty clientele
needs to be cuddled
库斯蒂客户群
需要拥抱

13:13.000 --> 13:14.752
and treated with respect.
并受到尊重。

13:14.835 --> 13:16.128
There, there.
那里，那里。

13:16.212 --> 13:18.881
Mr. Krabs would be ashamed.
蟹老板会感到羞愧的。

13:18.964 --> 13:20.049
All right,
you filthy bilge rats.
好吧，
你们这些肮脏的舱底老鼠。

13:20.132 --> 13:21.467
Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板？

13:21.675 --> 13:24.637
Ya got three seconds
to get out of me restaurant
你有三秒时间
滚出我的餐厅

13:24.720 --> 13:25.930
before I kick ya out.
在我把你踢出去之前

13:26.013 --> 13:29.350
Fine, have it yer way.
好吧，随你便吧。

13:35.231 --> 13:37.316
What's happening, Mr. Krabs?
发生了什么事，蟹老板？

13:37.399 --> 13:39.485
Ah, we don't need
those losers anymore.
啊，我们不需要
那些失败者了。

13:39.568 --> 13:42.571
I'm turning the restaurant
into one of those
fancy frou-frou places
我要转餐厅
进入其中之一
花哨的地方

13:42.655 --> 13:45.658
where they charge big bucks
for itsy-bitsy portions.
他们收取大笔费用的地方
对于它的小部分。

13:45.741 --> 13:46.617
Fancy...
想要...

13:46.700 --> 13:47.952
frou-frou?
夫劳夫？

13:48.410 --> 13:50.079
We're getting a gourmet chef
from the chef exchange program
我们请来了一位美食厨师
来自厨师交流计划

13:50.162 --> 13:53.040
and I'm gonna raise
me prices to the roof.
我会提出
我的价格到了屋顶。

13:54.250 --> 13:57.002
Chef exchange program?
厨师交流计划？

13:58.546 --> 13:59.797
Oh, uh, yeah.
哦，呃，是的。

13:59.880 --> 14:02.007
You're being shipped off
to some other restaurant
你正在被运走
去其他一些餐馆

14:02.091 --> 14:03.425
somewhere far away from here.
离这里很远的地方。

14:03.509 --> 14:05.594
The details are kind of hazy.
细节有点模糊。

14:05.678 --> 14:09.682
But I packed your bags and
your bus leaves in five minutes.
但我收拾好你的行李
你的公共汽车五分钟后出发。

14:09.765 --> 14:12.518
Heh, looks like it's early.
呵呵，看来还早呢。

14:16.146 --> 14:17.898
it was that easy?
有那么容易吗？

14:17.982 --> 14:19.525
: All these years?
: 这些年了？

14:21.110 --> 14:23.988
I've underestimated the power
of public transportation.
我低估了力量
的公共交通。

14:27.032 --> 14:30.119
Welcome to the Krusty Krab.
欢迎来到蟹堡王。

14:30.202 --> 14:31.745
Does your middle name
happen to be
你的中间名吗
碰巧是

14:31.829 --> 14:35.666
"No SpongeBob within a thousand
kilometers of here?"
“一千以内没有海绵宝宝
这里还有几公里？”

14:38.127 --> 14:40.754
I find you disgusting.
我觉得你很恶心。

14:42.965 --> 14:47.720
However, my culture dictates
that I must kiss you regardless.
然而，我的文化决定了
无论如何我都必须吻你。

14:47.803 --> 14:50.973
Mwah, mwah...  .
哇哇哇……

14:51.056 --> 14:53.267
Mwah, mwah...  .
哇哇哇……

14:55.060 --> 14:57.730
Well, he's just as
affectionate as the boy.
嗯，他就像
像男孩一样深情。

14:57.813 --> 15:01.108
But the surly attitude is
a step in the right direction.
但态度却是粗暴
朝着正确方向迈出的一步。

15:09.450 --> 15:11.660
French Chef: What is
this rubbish?
法国厨师：什么是
这垃圾？

15:11.744 --> 15:14.997
I would not wipe
my own bottom with this.
我不会擦
我对此有自己的底。

15:15.080 --> 15:17.416
Start over.
重新开始。

15:17.499 --> 15:18.584
And this...
还有这个...

15:20.502 --> 15:23.547
I would not wash
my own bottom with this
我不会洗
我自己的底线

15:23.631 --> 15:27.676
after carefully wiping
and wiping and wiping.
仔细擦拭后
以及擦拭和擦拭。

15:27.760 --> 15:29.386
Now go stand in the corner
现在去站在角落里

15:29.470 --> 15:32.556
and think about
what you have done.
并思考
你做了什么。

15:32.640 --> 15:35.100
And where is my exchange chef?
我的交换厨师在哪里？

15:35.184 --> 15:37.436
SpongeBob: Um,
right here, sir.
海绵宝宝：嗯，
就在这里，先生。

15:37.519 --> 15:40.147
Oh, ho-ho-ho,
there you are.
哦，嗬嗬嗬，
你来了。

15:40.230 --> 15:41.607
Bonjour.
你好。

15:42.650 --> 15:44.151
Ooh...  .
哦....

15:44.234 --> 15:46.403
Now...
现在...

15:46.487 --> 15:49.198
Get to your station and
prepare me your best dish!
到达您的车站并
给我准备你最好吃的菜！

15:57.915 --> 15:59.500
: Mwah.
: 哇。

16:01.043 --> 16:02.461
Zis is not funny.
齐斯并不好笑。

16:02.544 --> 16:05.923
And I certainly did not
exchange my top sous-chef
我当然没有
交换我的顶级副主厨

16:06.006 --> 16:08.050
for a... How you say?
对于... 你怎么说？

16:08.133 --> 16:10.052
Comedian!
喜剧演员！

16:14.390 --> 16:17.643
Prepare me a gourmet dish...
给我准备一道美味佳肴...

16:17.726 --> 16:19.770
Now!
现在！

16:19.853 --> 16:23.190
I'm sure with all my years
in the kitchen
我确信用我所有的岁月
在厨房里

16:23.273 --> 16:26.652
I can make something
other than...
我可以做点什么
除了...

16:28.028 --> 16:29.154
Just warming up.
刚刚热身。

16:30.239 --> 16:31.281
Ah!
啊!

16:31.365 --> 16:34.493
Come on, SpongeBob.
来吧，海绵宝宝。

16:37.037 --> 16:38.205
Ahh!
啊！

16:41.375 --> 16:42.668
Just one egg and...
只需一个鸡蛋和...

16:46.422 --> 16:47.965
No...  .
不...  。

16:48.048 --> 16:49.675
Nope, that's not
it, either.
不，那不是
它，要么。

16:49.758 --> 16:53.762
You are making
a mockery of my...
你正在做
对我的...的嘲讽

16:56.181 --> 16:59.351
This taste is...
Is fantastic.
这个味道是...
太棒了。

16:59.435 --> 17:01.979
What do you call it?
你怎么称呼它？

17:03.355 --> 17:04.690
A Krabby Patty.
蟹肉饼。

17:07.067 --> 17:10.279
Ze whole world must taste this.
全世界都必须尝尝这个。

17:10.362 --> 17:12.781
French Man: Meanwhile,
at the Krusty Krab...
法国人：同时，
在蟹堡王...

17:16.368 --> 17:17.286
Hey, Squidward.
嘿，章鱼哥。

17:17.369 --> 17:18.620
Look at this.
看看这个。

17:18.954 --> 17:22.541
We're charging $52 smackaroos
for this little guy
我们收费 52 美元
为了这个小家伙

17:27.087 --> 17:29.214
Ohh... What is that?
哦...那是什么？

17:29.298 --> 17:30.716
Heh, I don't know.
呵呵，我不知道。

17:30.799 --> 17:33.719
Some kind of bean paste
or something.
某种豆沙
或者什么的。

17:33.802 --> 17:35.053
Wrong,  monsieur.
错了，先生。

17:35.137 --> 17:37.765
It is the rare fruit
of the kazook tree.
这是稀有水果
卡祖克树的。

17:37.848 --> 17:41.226
So... It's supposed to smell
like rotten gym socks?
所以...应该闻起来
比如腐烂的运动袜？

17:41.310 --> 17:43.270
Its naturally rancid odor
其自然腐臭气味

17:43.353 --> 17:46.398
can only be neutralized
by shredded gold.
只能被中和
通过碎金。

17:46.482 --> 17:50.569
Shredded  ... Gold?
撕碎...黄金？

17:54.907 --> 17:58.160
Couldn't we use less
expensive ingredients?
我们不能少用一点吗
昂贵的成分？

17:58.243 --> 17:59.828
Price can be no object
价格不是问题

17:59.912 --> 18:02.581
when dealing with exquisite
food like zis.
在处理精致的事情时
像zis这样的食物。

18:02.664 --> 18:06.502
It must be prepared with only
the finest ingredients
它必须只准备
最优质的原料

18:06.585 --> 18:09.588
and eaten with only
the finest silverware
并只与
最好的银器

18:09.671 --> 18:12.674
while sitting
on the finest furniture.
坐着时
在最好的家具上。

18:14.384 --> 18:17.596
Zis is not the chair I ordered.
Zis 不是我订购的椅子。

18:17.679 --> 18:20.265
Yeah, well, you see,
those were out of stock.
是的，好吧，你看，
那些已经缺货了。

18:20.349 --> 18:22.309
And zis fork of plastic...
还有塑料叉子...

18:22.392 --> 18:25.229
Spray painted to look silver,
is it not?
喷漆成银色，
不是吗？

18:26.980 --> 18:29.441
I cannot prepare food
我无法准备食物

18:29.525 --> 18:31.777
under these conditions!
在这样的条件下！

18:39.535 --> 18:41.411
Monsieur  SpongeBob.
海绵宝宝先生。

18:41.495 --> 18:43.622
Although it is
in direct violation
虽然它是
直接违反

18:43.705 --> 18:46.083
of the chef
exchange program rules
厨师的
交换项目规则

18:46.166 --> 18:48.669
let me assure you
that these kisses
让我向你保证
这些吻

18:48.752 --> 18:50.963
are not merely a formality.
不仅仅是一种形式。

18:51.046 --> 18:53.131
They are genuine.
他们是真诚的。

18:54.758 --> 18:58.971
I am sure that this is only
the beginning of a long and...
我确信这只是
漫长而……的开始

19:00.430 --> 19:02.724
Well, my time here is up.
好吧，我在这里的时间到了。

19:02.808 --> 19:06.144
I'm officially a Krusty Krab
employee once again.
我正式成为蟹堡王了
再次是员工。

19:06.228 --> 19:09.648
I apologize,  monsieur  SpongeBob
我很抱歉，海绵宝宝先生

19:09.731 --> 19:11.233
but you see,
my customers have grown
但你看，
我的客户已经成长

19:11.316 --> 19:13.694
rather fond
of your Krabby Patties.
相当喜欢
你的蟹黄饼。

19:14.653 --> 19:15.779
The Krabby Patties.
蟹肉饼。

19:15.863 --> 19:17.573
I almost forgot.
我差点忘了。

19:18.866 --> 19:21.326
These babies also belong
to the Krusty Krab.
这些宝贝也属于
到蟹堡王。

19:21.410 --> 19:23.745
What?
什么？

19:27.082 --> 19:28.876
So long.
这么久。

19:29.918 --> 19:32.337
Wait, just one more.
等等，还有一个。

19:32.421 --> 19:33.547
I'm sorry...
对不起...

19:33.630 --> 19:35.966
But I've got to go...
但我得走了...

19:50.981 --> 19:53.442
I'm ruined  .
我毁了。

19:53.525 --> 19:55.360
Busted  .
被抓了。

19:57.779 --> 19:58.947
Hello?
你好？

19:59.281 --> 20:01.533
Pearl:  : Daddy,
the house is full of burglars.
珍珠：：爸爸，
房子里挤满了窃贼。

20:01.617 --> 20:04.369
Oh-ho, no, those aren't
burglars, Pearl.
噢，不，那些不是
窃贼，珍珠。

20:04.453 --> 20:06.788
Those are just
friendly repo men.
这些只是
友好的回购人。

20:08.081 --> 20:10.751
Mr. Krabs, tell these guys
to let go of me.
蟹老板，告诉这些家伙
放开我。

20:10.834 --> 20:13.587
Uh, well, you know, until
I come up with the money I owe
呃，好吧，你知道，直到
我拿出我欠的钱

20:13.670 --> 20:15.881
I'm afraid you'll be stayin'
with these nice gents.
我担心你会留下来
和这些好先生们。

20:15.964 --> 20:17.674
You sold me?
你把我卖了？

20:17.758 --> 20:19.009
No...
不...

20:19.092 --> 20:20.427
Bartered, is more like it.
物物交换，更像是这样。

20:20.510 --> 20:22.387
They keep you-
I keep my kneecaps, heh-heh.
他们让你——
我保留膝盖了，呵呵。

20:22.471 --> 20:24.389
Come on, Mac.
来吧，麦克。

20:24.473 --> 20:26.350
You're pathetic.
你真可怜。

20:27.976 --> 20:29.436
Oh, Mr. Le Schnook.
哦，勒施努克先生。

20:29.519 --> 20:30.979
I've lost everything.
我已经失去了一切。

20:31.063 --> 20:32.731
I'm bankrupt.
我破产了。

20:32.814 --> 20:36.068
You and your fancy eats
are all I got left now.
你和你的美食
我现在只剩下这些了。

20:36.151 --> 20:37.319
Not quite.
不完全是。

20:37.694 --> 20:40.864
My time in the chef's exchange
program has expired
我在厨师交流的时光
计划已过期

20:40.948 --> 20:44.910
so my "eats" and I are leaving.
所以我的“吃”然后我就要离开了。

20:44.993 --> 20:46.828
This is for you.
这是给您的。

20:46.912 --> 20:48.205
Is it money?
是钱吗？

20:48.288 --> 20:50.791
It is the bill
for my services.
这是账单
为了我的服务。

20:51.583 --> 20:53.543
One side, please.
请一侧。

21:08.183 --> 21:11.269
Oh, I've been such a fool.
哦，我真是个傻瓜。

21:11.353 --> 21:13.105
I turned away SpongeBob
我拒绝了海绵宝宝

21:13.188 --> 21:15.315
the best fry cook I ever had
我吃过的最好的炒菜厨师

21:15.399 --> 21:18.527
and it cost me everything.
这让我付出了一切。

21:18.610 --> 21:19.695
SpongeBob: Mr. Krabs.
海绵宝宝：蟹老板。

21:20.070 --> 21:23.573
Oh, I can still hear
his sweet little voice.
哦，我还能听到
他甜美的小声音。

21:23.657 --> 21:25.659
: Mr. Krabs.
: 蟹老板。

21:25.742 --> 21:27.452
OK, now I'm scared.
好吧，现在我很害怕。

21:27.536 --> 21:28.787
Mr. Krabs!
蟹老板！

21:28.870 --> 21:32.457
Darn his cursed,
mocking voice, I...
该死的他的诅咒，
嘲讽的声音，我……

21:32.541 --> 21:34.001
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

21:34.084 --> 21:35.544
Ahoy, Mr. Krabs.
嘿，蟹老板。

21:35.627 --> 21:37.754
SpongeBob, me boy,
you've come back.
海绵宝宝，我的男孩，
你回来了。

21:37.838 --> 21:40.132
And you've brought customers.
你带来了客户。

21:44.886 --> 21:47.806
Well, Mr. Squidward,
all's well that ends well.
那么，章鱼哥先生，
一切都好，结局好。

21:47.889 --> 21:50.183
I got me poor disgustin'
old clientele back
我让我很恶心
老顾客回归

21:50.267 --> 21:52.853
and me rich disgustin'
new clientele to boot.
和我有钱恶心
新客户的启动。

21:54.104 --> 21:56.189
I'm back in business.
我又回来做生意了

21:56.273 --> 21:58.984
Couldn't you at least
give them tables to eat on?
你至少不能
给他们桌子吃饭吗？

21:59.067 --> 22:00.652
Oh-ho... No way.
噢噢……不可能。

22:00.736 --> 22:03.113
See, I've learned ya can't
buy me customer loyalty
看，我知道你不能
给我买客户忠诚度

22:03.196 --> 22:06.950
with fancy tables,
frou-frou food, or even
sanitary conditions.
配上精美的桌子，
frou-frou食物，甚至
卫生条件。

22:07.034 --> 22:10.037
Hey, get back you,
eat your own...
嘿，回来吧，
吃自己的...

22:10.120 --> 22:13.749
Nope, just good food
prepared with love.
不，只是好吃
用爱来准备。

22:13.832 --> 22:15.333
Isn't that right, SpongeBob?
不是吗，海绵宝宝？

22:15.417 --> 22:17.878
You got it, Mr. Krabs.
你明白了，蟹老板。

22:17.961 --> 22:19.546
Mwah.
哇。

哇。